   "cooked": "<h2>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#round-25-summary-included-below-this-post-point_down-1\" name=\"round-25-summary-included-below-this-post-point_down-1\"></a><em>Round 25 Summary included below this post</em> <img alt=\":point_down:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/point_down.png?v=10\" title=\":point_down:\"/>\n</h2>\n<p><strong>This is the first distribution using the new method of providing bonus rewards for non-contributors, <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/reduce-rewards-for-regular-paid-contributors/1062\">read more here.</a></strong> <img alt=\":moneybag:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/moneybag.png?v=10\" title=\":moneybag:\"/></p>\n<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-24-061222-to-201222-2\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-24-061222-to-201222-2\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-24  - 06/12/22 to 20/12/22</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>06 December 2022 and 17 December 2022</strong>. We allocated <strong>246.11</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, with a <strong>100:0</strong> split between Praise and Sourcecred. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/e046e2a9bd7f966646b10d6843c9ba324fbcaa7a/distribution_rounds/round-24/distribution_results/reports/round-24--general-round-analysis-report.html\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Username</th>\n<th>Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td>34.92</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>mateodaza#3156</td>\n<td>36.05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Nuggan#5183</td>\n<td>22.72</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td>20.93</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td>9.47</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>enti#1546</td>\n<td>8.98</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bear100#9085</td>\n<td>7.78</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td>8.88</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>innov8tor3#3988</td>\n<td>8.81</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>durgadas#9280</td>\n<td>3.94</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ygg_anderson#4998</td>\n<td>7.73</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rodricast#1415</td>\n<td>7.27</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maxwe11#7157</td>\n<td>5.91</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tamarandom#9361</td>\n<td>5.54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>acidlazzer#5796</td>\n<td>2.65</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WaKa#6616</td>\n<td>4.67</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>paul2#3057</td>\n<td>3.95</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kris Paruch#0738</td>\n<td>3.89</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>r33pich33p#6906</td>\n<td>2.83</t