   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-25-201222-to-010123-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-25-201222-to-010123-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-25  - 20/12/22 to 01/01/23</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>20 December 2022 and 23 December 2022</strong>. We allocated <strong>62.269</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, with a <strong>100:0</strong> split between Praise and Sourcecred. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/e046e2a9bd7f966646b10d6843c9ba324fbcaa7a/distribution_rounds/round-25/distribution_results/reports/round-25--general-round-analysis-report.html\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.691</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.454</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2.623</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Vyvy-vi#5040</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.341</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">akrtws (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#4246</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.265</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">SatoriD#2945</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.265</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Jolly LaMa#5962</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.963</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">pat.zip (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#5266</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.963</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">solsista#5370</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.963</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">\n<img alt=\":octopus:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/octopus.png?v=10\" title=\":octopus:\"/> octopus#5508</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.963</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Letty#5399</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.775</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.699</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">angieberry.eth#9822</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">3.661</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Sha#6179</td>\n<td styl